<title>HUNGARY: Hungary BSE to allow foreigners BUX futures trade.</title>
<headline>Hungary BSE to allow foreigners BUX futures trade.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Council of the Budapest Stock Exchange approved regulations to allow foreigners to trade in BUX index futures, the BSE said on Wednesday in its official gazette.</p>
<p>The BSE did not disclose when foreigners could begin trading in BUX index futures, and BSE officials were not available for comment.</p>
<p>Press reports said the trading could begin as soon as the end of December if bourse members modify their internal business regulations in the next few days.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
